 "notes": "SIGNATURE. Horizontal, rising, overhead — a chain that climbs. The only axe whose light attacks cover three different heights, so a crouching enemy and a standing one are both answered.\n\nLineage: hatchet — Short hatchets held near the head: flatter, faster, and they hook a shield rim rather than splitting it.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 34.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
